Edit Template

PUT /v2/accounts//templates

Include the `id` field in the template object to identify which template to update.

Delete Template

DELETE /v2/accounts//templates?waba_id=

Request Body

{
  "whatsapp": {
    "templates": [{
      "template": { "name": "template_name" }
    }]
  }
}

